Aether is a visual theming application for the Omarchy desktop, usable
standalone on other desktops as well.  It extracts a 16-color palette from
a wallpaper using a median-cut algorithm, offers several extraction modes
and fine-tuning sliders, includes a wallpaper browser and editor, and
applies cohesive themes to Hyprland, Waybar, terminals, editors and other
applications through a template system.  It also offers a command line
interface and IPC commands for scripting.
